8	 * The project registry: operator-configured associations between an opaque project ID, a repository and
9	 * one or more workflow run roots. Loaded once at startup from MD_MANAGER_PROJECTS_CONFIG, independently of
10	 * the skills configuration. Unset means an empty registry; an explicitly supplied file that is missing or
11	 * invalid fails startup. Requests can never add, change or select a root, and a run's own `plan.json` never
12	 * registers anything: runs belong to a workflow solely because they live under its configured `runs_root`.
13	 */
